## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `src/root.zig` | The library module (importable as `<% .Snake %>`), with its tests |
| `src/main.zig` | The executable: argument handling and output |
| `build.zig` | Build graph: `zig build`, `zig build run`, `zig build test` |
| `build.zig.zon` | Package manifest: name, version, fingerprint, dependencies |
| `docs/` | Documentation and ADRs |

Zig is pre-1.0 and its standard library changes between releases. This project targets Zig 0.17.1
(`minimum_zig_version`).

## Decisions

Record significant decisions as short ADRs in `docs/adr/` (one file per decision).
